wifi-fortress (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Passphrase Hardening page: models offline attack resistance for the
    passphrase you set on your own router, per hardware tier, with weakest-link
    analysis, WPA3-SAE comparison and a concrete fix list. The verdict feeds the
    Security Audit.
  * Dictionary Manager: catalogue of 49 verified public word lists, 24 of them
    downloadable in one click, with Download / Download + import, category and
    Wi-Fi filters, and per-file licence, origin and SHA-256 preserved.
  * Database: additive migration so upgrades keep existing dictionaries.

 -- WiFi Fortress <wififortress@localhost>  Mon, 05 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0200

